4️⃣ Research Document
Research Objective

To study transaction behavior, service performance, failure patterns, and seasonality in PhonePe business services.

Data Sources

User dataset

Transaction dataset

Service-specific datasets (Loans, Insurance, Recharge, Money Transfer)

Key Research Questions

Which service contributes most to revenue?

Why are transactions failing?

Which months show peak activity?

Which services are underperforming?

Key Findings

Loans contribute over 79% of revenue

Server errors are the top failure reason

Q3 (July–September) is the peak period

Recharge & Bills show stable trends
